hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2727","Narrated to us Muhammad bin Maymun al-Makki, who said: Narrated to us Abu Sa'id, the freed slave of Banu Hashim, 'Abdur-Rahman bin 'Abdullah, who said: Narrated to us Isra'il, from 'Abdullah bin Muslim bin Hurmuz, from Mujahid, from Ibn 'Abbas (RA) who said: ""The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) kissed the Yemeni Corner (Rukn al-Yamani) and placed his cheek upon it."""
